    "primary_engineering_error_policy": "From QF_solver 0.2.1a0 onward, every primary engineering observable used for V&V or stable promotion must have a relative error <= 1 percent against its declared reference. A value > 1 percent blocks stable promotion unless a formal mechanical justification, reproducible additional refinement, and a dated Owner decision are recorded. Residuals, mesh increments and conditioning diagnostics remain separate acceptance criteria."
